# Promoter-window MSA generation. Only the three generators at the top level are
# tracked (~38 KB).
#
# NOT tracked:
#   aligned/              279 MB of generated promoter FASTAs — the data itself
#   slurm_logs/           49 MB of job output, plus the 49 generated
#                         _sbatch_<locus>.sh scripts, which submit_promoter_msa.py
#                         writes. Hence *.sh is NOT allowlisted here: the only
#                         shell scripts in this tree are machine-generated.
#   promoter_windows.json the computed coordinate table. Regenerable with
#                         `python build_promoter_coords.py`; excluded as derived
#                         data. Track it if you ever need the windows pinned
#                         rather than recomputed.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!*.md
!/*.py
